---
// Module 2: Intervals and Generators. Same five-block rhythm. Behold
// animates the cycle of fifths drawing itself, Derive lets the listener
// flip through intervals 1-11 and watch gcd land different shapes,
// Operate makes the orbit audible by building it on the piano one note
// at a time.
import Module2Behold from './Module2Behold';
import Module2Derive from './Module2Derive';
import Module2Operate from './Module2Operate';
import Module2Prompts from './Module2Prompts';
---

<div class="m m2">
  <section class="m-block m2-block">
    <p class="m-eyebrow">behold</p>
    <p>
      Start on C. Step up by seven semitones — a perfect fifth — and you
      land on G. Step again: D. Again: A. Twelve steps later, you have
      visited every pitch class and the line closes back on itself. The
      cycle of fifths isn't a notational convention; it's what happens
      when you let an interval generate its own subgroup of Z<sub>12</sub>.
    </p>
    <Module2Behold client:visible />
  </section>

  <section class="m-block m2-block">
    <p class="m-eyebrow">derive</p>
    <p>
      The interval N generates a cyclic subgroup whose size is{' '}
      <code>12 / gcd(N, 12)</code>. When gcd is 1, the orbit is all of
      Z<sub>12</sub> — N is a generator. When gcd is bigger than 1, the
      orbit is a proper subset whose <em>shape</em> is one of the
      symmetric chord types: whole-tone, diminished seventh, augmented
      triad, tritone pair. Pick any interval and watch.
    </p>
    <Module2Derive client:visible />
  </section>

  <section class="m-block m2-block">
    <p class="m-eyebrow">operate</p>
    <p>
      Now hear it. Pick an interval; press <strong>build the orbit</strong>;
      the piano stacks the orbit's pcs one at a time, each note
      sustained. Step 4 lands on an augmented triad. Step 3 on a
      diminished seventh. Step 2 on the whole-tone scale. Step 7 piles
      up every pitch class.
    </p>
    <Module2Operate client:visible />
  </section>

  <section class="m-block m2-block">
    <p class="m-eyebrow">prompt</p>
    <p class="m-prompt-intro">
      Two cards on gcd and orbit size. Same "unsure" rule — it brings the
      card back around sooner.
    </p>
    <Module2Prompts client:visible />
  </section>

  <section class="m-block m2-block m-bridge m2-bridge">
    <p class="m-eyebrow">bridge</p>
    <p>
      Generators give us chords by repetition; gcd dictates the shape.
      But the <em>diatonic</em> scale — seven notes from twelve — isn't
      a single orbit. Where does it come from? Next: scales as subsets,
      with one specific subset standing out as the maximally even
      seven-note set.
    </p>
  </section>
</div>

<style is:global>
  /* Module 2 chrome. Mirrors Modules 0 + 1; rules live next to those so
     the page-wide style remains uniform without any cross-module
     imports. Chrome (.m, .m-block, .m-eyebrow, .m p, .m-bridge p,
     .m-prompts, .m-prompt-intro) lives in curriculum/index.astro. */

  /* Behold ---------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .m2-behold {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    padding: 1rem;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
    cursor: pointer;
    max-width: 320px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
  }
  .m2-behold:hover,
  .m2-behold:focus-visible {
    border-color: var(--accent-dim);
    outline: none;
  }
  .m2-behold-caption {
    font-size: 0.9rem !important;
    color: var(--text-dim) !important;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 !important;
    line-height: 1.5 !important;
    max-width: 36ch;
  }
  .m2-behold-caption strong {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  /* Interval picker — shared by Derive + Operate ----------------------- */
  .m2-interval-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .m2-interval-label {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .m2-interval-buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .m2-interval-btn {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.1rem;
    min-width: 2.6rem;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.4rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 3px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    transition:
      background 0.15s ease,
      color 0.15s ease,
      border-color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .m2-interval-btn:hover:not(:disabled):not(.active) {
    border-color: var(--accent-dim);
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m2-interval-btn.active {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--bg);
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m2-interval-btn:disabled {
    opacity: 0.5;
    cursor: default;
  }
  .m2-interval-n {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .m2-interval-name {
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .m2-interval-btn.active .m2-interval-name {
    color: var(--bg);
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  /* Derive ---------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .m2-derive {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.1rem;
    margin: 1rem 0;
    padding: 1.25rem 1rem;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .m2-derive-stats {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .m2-stat {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.15rem;
  }
  .m2-stat-label {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.58rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .m2-stat-value {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m2-stat-shape {
    font-family: var(--font-crimson);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }
  .m2-derive-caption {
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 !important;
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.78rem !important;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--text-dim) !important;
    line-height: 1.5 !important;
  }
  .m2-derive-close {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  /* Operate --------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .m2-operate {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.1rem;
    margin: 1rem 0;
    padding: 1.25rem 1rem;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .m2-operate-controls {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .m2-operate-play {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 0.45rem 1.1rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition:
      background 0.15s ease,
      color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .m2-operate-play:hover:not(:disabled) {
    background: var(--accent-dim);
    border-color: var(--accent-dim);
  }
  .m2-operate-play:disabled {
    cursor: default;
    background: var(--bg-button);
    color: var(--text-dim);
    border-color: var(--border);
  }
  .m2-operate-release {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 0.45rem 0.95rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition:
      color 0.15s ease,
      border-color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .m2-operate-release:hover:not(:disabled) {
    color: var(--accent);
    border-color: var(--accent-dim);
  }
  .m2-operate-release:disabled {
    cursor: default;
    opacity: 0.4;
  }
  .m2-operate-caption {
    font-size: 0.9rem !important;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--text-dim) !important;
    margin: 0 !important;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 42ch;
    line-height: 1.5 !important;
  }
  .m2-operate-caption strong {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

</style>
